WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:32.300 --> 01:35.310
What should I do?
Which one should I give to him?

01:35.310 --> 01:36.470
To whom?

01:36.470 --> 01:37.950
Isn't it obvious that the chocolates are for Morita.

01:40.650 --> 01:41.310
What's going on?

01:41.910 --> 01:43.080
It's a chocolate shop. ~ Kero

01:43.720 --> 01:44.790
Chocolate?

01:50.790 --> 01:53.960
Ah! It's so cute! Chocolate roses!

01:54.590 --> 01:56.170
It's a new product this year.

01:57.600 --> 01:58.760
Oh, Chocolat.

01:59.430 --> 02:02.030
Say Chocolat, who are you giving it to?

02:02.030 --> 02:04.180
Mimura-kun? Or Akira-kun?

02:04.600 --> 02:07.440
Huh? Why should I give those guys chocolate?

02:09.210 --> 02:12.820
What are you saying?! This a
once a year chance at love!

02:13.280 --> 02:14.570
Chance at love?

02:14.850 --> 02:17.780
Don't tell me you don't know about Valentine's day.

02:18.120 --> 02:19.410
Valentine's day?

02:19.720 --> 02:21.720
You are just acting innocent.

02:22.190 --> 02:24.790
Honestly, you are going to give it someone, right?

02:25.320 --> 02:31.200
As for me, of course I'll be giving
Pierre-sama a chocolate rose!

02:31.200 --> 02:33.430
I'll give chocolates to my classmate
from the private school.

02:33.770 --> 02:37.100
I see... But I don't have anyone
I want to give chocolates to.

02:39.200 --> 02:41.070
Unbelievable.

02:41.070 --> 02:43.270
And it is a the long-awaited Valentine's day.

02:45.040 --> 02:48.510
Chocolat, A Chocolate Filled With Sentiments.

02:51.120 --> 02:53.120
Finally, it's this time of year again.

02:53.690 --> 02:55.390
Last year was devastating.

02:56.090 --> 02:57.520
Core Score: Zero
(Obligation chocolate)

02:57.520 --> 03:00.290
I only got giri-chocolate from my parents.

03:00.290 --> 03:01.160
Me too.

03:01.790 --> 03:04.720
The guy who gets more chocolate then the others

03:04.720 --> 03:08.970
is like he has an invisible insignia
of superiority for one whole year.

03:08.970 --> 03:13.170
Listen! This year, the losers shall run
around the patio only in underwear.

03:13.440 --> 03:15.170
Huh? Are you serious?!

03:15.610 --> 03:16.960
Give me a break.

03:16.960 --> 03:19.810
Listen here. This is for everyone's sake.

03:19.810 --> 03:21.930
Why is it for everyone's sake?

03:22.380 --> 03:24.760
From now on, if you start making necessary arrangements earnestly,

03:24.760 --> 03:27.690
we should be able to acquire more chocolates than last year.

03:27.690 --> 03:28.930
Our cornerstone is the willingness!

03:29.190 --> 03:30.250
Yes!

03:31.360 --> 03:34.890
I wonder if it is true that Chocolat
really doesn't like anyone.

03:35.490 --> 03:37.630
Judging from her mood and
manner, it seems to be true.

03:38.100 --> 03:41.130
I can't believe it! She is old-fashioned.

03:41.130 --> 03:42.200
I know right.

03:42.600 --> 03:43.470
Did you hear that?

03:43.970 --> 03:47.210
Maybe Kato will give us chocolate if we ask her.

03:47.210 --> 03:49.410
Our aim is Chocolat's chocolate.

03:50.710 --> 03:52.370
I can hear you!

03:52.680 --> 03:53.960
This is bad, she heard us!

03:54.410 --> 03:56.480
I'm not going to give chocolates to anyone.

03:59.250 --> 04:01.490
We've lost one valuable chocolate.

04:04.620 --> 04:09.890
Vanilla-chama, lately the humans
seem to be acting strange.

04:10.460 --> 04:13.000
Ah, isn't that because of Valentine's day?

04:13.670 --> 04:15.170
Valentine's day?

04:15.170 --> 04:16.540
What's that?

04:16.900 --> 04:18.640
In the Human World,

04:18.640 --> 04:25.710
girls give chocolate to boys as presents and confess their love in Valentine's day.

04:26.410 --> 04:27.110
Vanilla-san.

04:29.180 --> 04:33.880
This is bouquet of violets that you like.
It represent my heart, please accept it!

04:35.320 --> 04:37.020
Th-thank you.

04:37.020 --> 04:39.020
Well then, please remember
me and treat me favorably.

04:40.960 --> 04:41.560
What?

04:42.030 --> 04:43.760
I bet he wants a chocolate.

04:46.100 --> 04:50.630
It seems that everyone just want to get chocolate
instead of wanting to get feelings of love.

04:52.500 --> 04:53.440
Valentine's day...

04:54.170 --> 04:57.510
Giving chocolate and confessing your love, eh?

04:58.880 --> 05:00.080
Someone I like...

05:01.510 --> 05:02.530
Chocolat!

05:02.980 --> 05:04.650
Are you busy?

05:04.650 --> 05:07.570
Or should we fly to the moon?
We haven't done it in a long time.

05:09.890 --> 05:13.040
What do you want? You two want chocolate?

05:13.390 --> 05:15.060
Yeah! Give me one.

05:15.060 --> 05:19.290
No, that wasn't my intention. I do want some though.

05:19.290 --> 05:21.430
Well, here you go.

05:23.840 --> 05:26.160
I can get chocolates whenever I want.

05:26.160 --> 05:30.910
This is my specialty, I been able to do it since I was little.

05:30.910 --> 05:36.110
Chocolat, give us a real valentine's day
chocolate instead of this kind of chocolate.

05:36.110 --> 05:39.150
Or rather, why are you mad, Chocolat?

05:39.520 --> 05:44.650
If I were you, I will be happy to receive chocolate
from the person I like even if it is small.

05:44.650 --> 05:47.330
That's why I want your chocolate!

05:47.330 --> 05:50.160
Yeah. One that is filled with heart.

05:50.160 --> 05:51.870
Jeez...

05:54.800 --> 05:58.340
Valentine's day huh?
Did you hear that, Nana?

05:58.340 --> 06:04.480
Yes, I heard perfectly. You should
not miss this opportunity.

06:04.480 --> 06:11.080
I'll take Houx-sama's heart with my special chocolate, you'll see! Help me out, Nana!

06:11.080 --> 06:13.420
As you wish.

06:15.950 --> 06:17.410
What's the matter?

06:17.410 --> 06:22.490
We finally came to the Human World, so let's just enjoy this Human World event.

06:22.490 --> 06:24.260
Why are you mad?

06:24.260 --> 06:26.300
It doesn't matter!

06:26.900 --> 06:28.450
What's wrong Chocolat-chan?

06:28.450 --> 06:30.170
Ah. Vanilla.

06:30.170 --> 06:31.200
Uh... Hi.

06:33.600 --> 06:40.240
They want a chocolate filled with heart.
I'm a witch. I can't give anyone my heart.

06:40.240 --> 06:42.510
But you can give them chocolate.

06:44.120 --> 06:44.980
Robin!

06:44.980 --> 06:50.200
The chocolate is the only substitute of the heart that is sweet and bitter.

06:50.200 --> 06:54.100
Humans are just imitating. Did you know about that?

06:54.460 --> 06:56.920
Chocolate is the substitute for the heart?

06:56.920 --> 06:59.440
Then, will it be alright if I give it
to someone I like?

06:59.800 --> 07:02.190
If you keep it as secret, that is.

07:02.670 --> 07:04.230
Not telling anyone...

07:05.570 --> 07:08.040
Well then, I wonder if i should make some chocolate too.

07:08.040 --> 07:10.400
There are some ingredients
that are left over.

07:10.680 --> 07:15.160
If Vanilla-chama becomes serious,
Chocolat's chocolate won't be match at all.

07:15.610 --> 07:17.500
Vanilla, you're gonna make chocolate?

07:17.820 --> 07:20.620
Yeah! Chocolat-chan, would
you like to make it with me?

07:21.150 --> 07:27.090
No, I'm fine. Leaving that aside,
is there someone you like?

07:27.390 --> 07:33.140
No, how could there be?
Isn't it fine to eat with girls?

07:33.700 --> 07:35.700
Yeah... you're right.

07:38.370 --> 07:40.910
Alright, I'm going to make a lot!

07:40.910 --> 07:42.600
And I'll help!

07:43.240 --> 07:46.140
First off, you have to melt the chocolate.

07:48.410 --> 07:51.220
What a lovely smell! Now, after this...

07:51.220 --> 07:55.980
Waffle-sama, Prunus Persica's petal that
informs the arrival of the spring,

07:55.980 --> 07:59.960
Just like a maiden that does not know about love, become a slave of love.

07:59.960 --> 08:05.360
It has the power to make people become a "love's slave".

08:05.360 --> 08:08.130
Really! Well then, I'll add those too.

08:08.400 --> 08:10.770
5 Black Cat seeds.

08:10.770 --> 08:15.170
Cross Beer that was poured with Pluto's light.

08:15.170 --> 08:18.180
Then, adding Five Peach's petal.

08:20.770 --> 08:27.350
When Houx-sama eats this chocolate,
he will be all over for you.

08:28.120 --> 08:30.460
Chocolat won't be a match for me!

08:30.460 --> 08:32.490
That's right!

08:34.330 --> 08:35.930
What's wrong? Do you have cold?

08:36.390 --> 08:39.360
It must be my imagination, suddenly I felt chill.

08:44.840 --> 08:46.670
Chocolat went to buy chocolate!

08:46.670 --> 08:48.770
Alright! I'm gonna get some!

08:48.770 --> 08:50.440
Moron, I will!

08:50.440 --> 08:51.140
I will!

08:57.220 --> 08:59.950
If I don't tell anyone... If it is a secret then...

09:03.090 --> 09:05.600
Thank goodness! It's still open.

09:10.030 --> 09:11.960
Ah, that kid from before.

09:11.960 --> 09:13.260
Is the store closed already?

09:13.870 --> 09:19.780
Well, I can open the store. But if you came
for chocolate, we already sold it.

09:20.040 --> 09:22.790
What?!... I see...

09:23.210 --> 09:24.510
I'm sorry.

09:24.510 --> 09:28.450
No, it's okay. It's my fault for coming late.

09:29.010 --> 09:30.800
Yeah, It's valentine's day after all.

09:31.220 --> 09:33.320
It can't be helped... I should give up.

09:34.350 --> 09:39.960
I'm a witch. Even if it is chocolate,
I can't give my heart to a boy.

09:41.860 --> 09:43.810
Give my heart to a boy?

09:44.200 --> 09:45.500
Oh, that's right...

09:46.360 --> 09:47.560
Oh, shoot!

09:49.270 --> 09:53.210
Who am I going to give chocolate?

09:53.740 --> 10:00.140
Two hearts are floating in the sky...
The hearts have been divided in two.

10:00.140 --> 10:02.830
That's my heart.

10:03.550 --> 10:07.250
The ugly gray one is for "I don't like",
the pink one is for "I love".

10:08.220 --> 10:09.620
I still do not understand the
meaning of the 'I love" one.

10:11.920 --> 10:15.360
The innocent face that I saw before when
he was playing with those kids.

10:15.360 --> 10:19.630
I sill think that that's the real Pierre...

10:20.000 --> 10:22.200
but Pierre is an ogre.

10:22.770 --> 10:24.630
He's after my life...

10:26.210 --> 10:27.070
Still...

10:28.840 --> 10:31.270
but... I can't stop my heart from beating fast.

10:31.880 --> 10:39.570
I know! I will seal these feelings
in a chocolate.

10:39.570 --> 10:43.280
Then these worries of mine will disappear.

10:43.640 --> 10:45.120
Hey you.

10:45.660 --> 10:46.260
Huh?

10:46.260 --> 10:49.750
Here you go. I had some of the chocolate left over.

10:49.750 --> 10:53.460
If you melt and shape it should become big.

10:54.070 --> 10:55.770
Thank you!

10:56.270 --> 11:00.130
You said that you don't have anyone you like in front of your friends.

11:00.130 --> 11:01.270
But in reality,
you have someone don't you?

11:03.640 --> 11:05.010
That's not it!

11:08.450 --> 11:13.020
It's just normal chocolate. It's now my
secret that others should not know.

11:13.520 --> 11:17.890
It's not my heart... it's not like I
can give my heart to anyone.

11:22.560 --> 11:23.690
Kero~

11:29.970 --> 11:32.340
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune.

11:34.870 --> 11:38.740
9 pieces of heart shaped sweet pink petals.

11:38.740 --> 11:41.210
9 golden apple seeds.

11:41.850 --> 11:45.330
9 drops of Rose Oil that was poured into
the golden light of the dawn of Venus.

11:46.280 --> 11:48.850
Now to mix these into the melted chocolate.

11:49.220 --> 11:54.090
This chocolate seals the heart
when someone falls in love.

11:54.960 --> 11:59.600
When I learned this at magical school, I said
to myself: "There is no way I will use this".

12:02.900 --> 12:08.000
If I was an ordinary girl, I could make this
chocolate for the sake of telling him my feelings...

12:09.740 --> 12:13.610
But I'm a witch. I'm not an ordinary girl.

12:22.550 --> 12:23.190
It's done!

12:24.460 --> 12:32.700
My chest just got a little lighter. I didn't know
that my feelings toward Pierre were so heavy.

12:34.030 --> 12:37.330
But it's all right. I won't lose my way anymore.

12:49.310 --> 12:51.620
Good morning! Give me a chocolate!

12:51.920 --> 12:53.870
What's this so suddenly?

12:53.870 --> 12:58.920
Give me chocolate!

12:58.920 --> 13:02.090
We can still live even if we don't get any chocolate.

13:02.090 --> 13:06.830
Liar. Didn't you say yesterday that you'd
die if you didn't get chocolate this year?

13:06.830 --> 13:09.770
Isn't nice, you're quite popular!

13:11.000 --> 13:11.840
Well, yeah!

13:11.840 --> 13:14.310
Actually, I already got two.

13:14.310 --> 13:17.100
What!? Let's calculate the total!

13:17.410 --> 13:21.850
Let's see... I have 3 right now, Taichi
has 4, and Kitajima has...

13:21.850 --> 13:26.680
Done! Now who is the one who is most
likely to receive chocolates...

13:28.750 --> 13:30.350
It's a tie!

13:30.350 --> 13:32.490
What do we do if we get the same points?

13:32.490 --> 13:35.530
In that case, we ALL can re-do it again.

13:36.030 --> 13:38.430
Stop thinking like that.

13:38.430 --> 13:41.710
This means that someone can become
number 1 with one more chocolate.

13:48.110 --> 13:50.610
I can't believe Mimura and the other boys!

13:50.610 --> 13:51.980
Yeah~

13:51.980 --> 13:52.810
Good morning!

13:53.380 --> 13:54.480
Ah, good morning!

13:56.010 --> 13:57.150
What's this?!

13:57.150 --> 13:59.820
Chocolat-chan, you brought chocolates too after all!

14:00.280 --> 14:03.150
And you said that you were
not going to give any at all.

14:05.360 --> 14:11.260
Why did I bring it? I sealed my feelings in
the chocolate, so this should have ended.

14:13.100 --> 14:16.030
I brought the chocolate... What am I planning to do?

14:19.900 --> 14:21.670
Kato brought chocolate!

14:22.010 --> 14:22.710
What?!

14:23.640 --> 14:24.410
Good morning!

14:25.480 --> 14:27.630
Ice-san, you brought chocolate too?

14:27.950 --> 14:30.590
Yeah! I thought we could all eat it together!

14:30.590 --> 14:31.180
Here!

14:35.690 --> 14:36.990
Th-thank you.

14:38.460 --> 14:39.560
Yeah... thank you.

14:40.120 --> 14:45.460
I should feel happy... but what's this empty feeling?

14:45.460 --> 14:50.430
"Let's all eat it together" That's 100 % giri huh?

14:50.870 --> 14:53.990
In the end, our numbers becomes a draw.

14:53.990 --> 14:57.980
Huh? Mimura-kun and the others
hearts didn't come out.

14:57.980 --> 15:01.550
I'm so moved to receive chocolate from Vanilla-chan!

15:01.550 --> 15:03.610
Even if it is giri chocolate, I'm happy!

15:06.980 --> 15:10.350
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

15:13.160 --> 15:13.630
Wand!

15:14.860 --> 15:16.830
Heart, heart, please come to me!

15:23.070 --> 15:25.730
Ohh yeah! Kato, is your chocolate
also a giri chocolate?

15:26.100 --> 15:26.370
Huh?

15:28.310 --> 15:30.470
That chocolate's for me!

15:30.470 --> 15:36.200
Hold on Saule, Chocolat will be troubled,
because that chocolate is for me.

15:36.200 --> 15:38.790
Why are you darn middle schoolers in here?

15:39.220 --> 15:42.290
Isn't that obvious? I came to receive
Chocolat's chocolate.

15:42.850 --> 15:44.790
You're wrong, that is mine.

15:46.120 --> 15:47.590
It's Houx-sama!

15:47.590 --> 15:49.670
Please accept my chocolate!

15:49.670 --> 15:51.910
No, take mine!

15:51.910 --> 15:54.180
Saule-sama, receive my chocolate!

15:54.470 --> 15:56.630
Kato's chocolate is mine!

15:56.630 --> 15:58.430
No, it's mine! mine!

16:00.670 --> 16:04.440
Houx-sama, please accept my chocolate!

16:04.440 --> 16:05.840
Huh?

16:05.840 --> 16:09.050
Yeah, Houx! YOU accept Waffle's chocolate!

16:09.710 --> 16:11.860
That's kinda...

16:12.220 --> 16:18.450
Houx-sama, please accept my chocolate!
I made it with all my heart!

16:18.450 --> 16:23.210
I get it, I get it. Later, okay?
I'm kinda busy right now!

16:23.730 --> 16:27.420
There isn't a such thing that could make you
busy besides receiving my chocolate!

16:28.150 --> 16:32.010
Who is this conceited kid? You
don't even go to our school.

16:32.010 --> 16:34.370
What do you mean conceited kid!?

16:34.370 --> 16:36.310
Go back to your home!

16:38.040 --> 16:40.100
Anyways Kato, give it to me!

16:40.410 --> 16:43.600
What are you saying? This is–

16:43.850 --> 16:46.920
It's mine! You stay away from this.

16:46.920 --> 16:47.860
What was that?!

16:52.590 --> 16:53.690
Damnit!

16:53.690 --> 16:55.190
Chocolat, watch out!

16:56.360 --> 16:57.700
Houx-sama!

16:59.800 --> 17:01.000
Chocolat-chan, look out!

17:06.540 --> 17:08.790
Are you alright, Chocolat-chan?

17:08.790 --> 17:10.570
Ow, ouch... ouch!

17:10.570 --> 17:13.000
The chocolate! Where did Kato's chocolate go?!

17:14.680 --> 17:16.450
Where did it go!?

17:16.450 --> 17:17.680
Where's Kato's chocolate?

17:19.520 --> 17:22.680
Could this be– no, it's not.

17:23.450 --> 17:26.020
Ahh! My chocolate!

17:26.020 --> 17:27.690
Ouch, ouch.

17:27.690 --> 17:29.390
Chocolat-chan, are you alright?

17:29.390 --> 17:30.020
Yeah...

17:30.020 --> 17:30.960
Where'd it go?

17:31.660 --> 17:32.780
Where is it?

17:34.400 --> 17:36.870
What was that sound just now?

17:40.500 --> 17:42.470
My chocolate...

17:45.210 --> 17:51.810
I-I'm sorry Kato... I'll put it back the way
it was... so, can you give it to me?

17:52.450 --> 17:54.720
No, I'll do it. So please Kato...

17:55.320 --> 17:56.650
No, I'll do it.

17:56.650 --> 17:58.250
I'll do it!

18:00.420 --> 18:02.130
Jeez! That's it!

18:02.130 --> 18:04.560
If you want chocolate that bad, I'll give it to you!

18:05.530 --> 18:08.060
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

18:18.280 --> 18:18.880
Wand!

18:23.110 --> 18:24.410
Chocolate Etoile!

18:24.850 --> 18:27.050
Turn my chocolate to star shaped pieces!

18:30.490 --> 18:32.550
Awesome, it's chocolate!

18:32.550 --> 18:34.760
It's raining chocolate!

18:34.760 --> 18:36.290
How's it doing that?

18:36.290 --> 18:38.660
Give me that! It's mine!

18:38.660 --> 18:39.860
It's mine. No, mine!

18:40.330 --> 18:43.430
Just look. It doesn't matter how they
get it as long as it's chocolate.

18:44.200 --> 18:48.710
But seriously. Who do you think Kato was
really going to give the chocolate to?

18:48.710 --> 18:52.900
No idea. But doesn't it feel like
she really likes that guy?

18:53.380 --> 18:55.810
I bet she made this earnestly.

18:56.250 --> 18:59.110
It feels like it is filled with heart.

18:59.450 --> 19:02.390
This kind of Kato is nice also.

19:03.450 --> 19:07.250
Ah, hearts! Chocolat-chan, their hearts came out!

19:07.690 --> 19:08.390
Huh!?

19:08.390 --> 19:09.560
Now is your chance!

19:09.560 --> 19:13.960
Agrandissement!
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco rune!

19:13.960 --> 19:15.230
Your hearts...

19:18.100 --> 19:19.220
Pick up!

19:29.480 --> 19:31.950
Alright! Those are pink ones!

19:32.380 --> 19:34.780
Huh? Chocolat, aren't you happy?

19:35.550 --> 19:37.750
No, it's not that.

19:38.960 --> 19:45.800
But... the stars became small pieces.
And I worked so hard to make it too.

19:47.500 --> 19:49.970
But this is probably for the best.

19:51.740 --> 19:53.200
I didn't get any chocolate.

19:55.470 --> 19:58.090
Duke, don't do that! You made it fall.

20:02.080 --> 20:02.750
Pierre..

20:10.890 --> 20:13.100
Chocolat, what's wrong?

20:13.520 --> 20:17.150
What should I do? Pierre has my chocolate!

20:24.990 --> 20:31.540
He ate it? What should I do?
The chocolate... Pierre ate it.

20:32.910 --> 20:36.810
But it's alright. I sealed my feelings in it...

20:38.650 --> 20:39.750
It's alright, isn't it?

20:43.430 --> 20:50.260
It's not here. Not here, not here, not here,
not here, where did my chocolate go?!

20:51.270 --> 20:58.230
Huh? There it is! My chocolate!
I can finally give it to Houx-sama.

21:00.370 --> 21:03.740
Huh? A d-dog!

21:05.610 --> 21:08.490
Waaaah, my chocolate!

21:10.580 --> 21:15.420
Ah! Could this be!? The love magic that
was supposed to be for Houx-sama...

21:22.230 --> 21:30.500
Vanilla-chama got 20 pee, 9 orange and
2 pink. 4,800 ecure?! How can this be!?

21:30.500 --> 21:34.400
Chocolat got 5 pink hearts and 5,000 ecure!

21:34.400 --> 21:38.980
It's so frustrating! I can't believe
Vanilla-chama lost against Chocolat!

21:38.980 --> 21:42.310
There, there Blanca, there are times like that too.

21:43.110 --> 21:45.820
It's skill. I'm just skilled.

21:46.180 --> 21:52.460
Ohh, that's right! Here! I forgot to give this
to you, it's your share of the chocolate!

21:53.060 --> 21:57.130
Really!? That makes me so happy!
Hey, let's eat it together!

21:57.130 --> 21:57.530
Okay!

21:57.530 --> 22:02.000
Ohh really. Vanilla-chama, you are just too nice.

22:02.000 --> 22:05.140
Blanca, you got any chocolate for me?

22:05.140 --> 22:06.840
Of course I don't!

22:08.440 --> 22:09.840
No, really, you do have some, don't you?

22:09.840 --> 22:11.770
I don't even have a piece.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:46.100 --> 23:50.480
Whenever I think about Pierre, it hurts for some reason.

23:51.530 --> 23:54.170
But when I play with Mimura,
it's really fun!

23:54.680 --> 23:59.970
Both of them are boys, but it is different... Why is that?

23:59.970 --> 24:02.730
Ahh, I gotta stop thinking about it!

24:02.730 --> 24:04.730
Mimura, where do you wanna go?

24:05.650 --> 24:07.730
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.730 --> 24:10.200
A friend's heart, precious thoughts.

24:10.800 --> 24:13.490
Everyone watch it or I'll whup your butt!
